    <div class="section">
        <h2>Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Welcome to <strong>Chat Media Cleaner</strong> ("we", "our", or "us").
            We respect your privacy by design. This application is built to function
            entirely on your device without collecting, storing, or transmitting personal data.
        </p>
        <p>
