            described in this Privacy Policy.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p><strong>None.</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>No personal identifiers</li>
            <li>No contacts, messages, or chat content</li>
            <li>No location data</li>
            <li>No device identifiers or advertising IDs</li>
            <li>No analytics or usage tracking</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Local File Access</h2>
        <p>
            Chat Media Cleaner accesses media files stored on your device (images, videos,
            audio, and documents) solely to allow you to:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>View file size, date, and location</li>
            <li>Identify unnecessary downloaded media</li>
            <li>Manually delete selected files</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            All processing happens <strong>locally on your device</strong>.
            No file data ever leaves your phone.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Permissions</h2>
        <p>
            The app requests Android media access permissions strictly to scan and manage
            files that you choose to review. These permissions are never used for
            background tracking, analytics, or data extraction.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>The app does not:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Share data with third parties</li>
            <li>Use advertising networks</li>
            <li>Use analytics SDKs</li>
            <li>Send data to servers</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Internet Usage</h2>
        <p>
            Chat Media Cleaner does not require an internet connection.
            All core features work fully offline.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>
            Since no personal data is collected or transmitted, there is no external
            data storage risk. All actions remain entirely under your control on your device.
        </p>
